label clubqend:
    play music "sil.ogg" fadein 2.0
    play sound "fx/gong.ogg"
    show cl base with dissolve
    uf4 "啊-"
    uf4 "看起来我们今天拥有的所有时间……"
    if persistent.clubpoints == -100:
        uf4 "...."
        show cl angry with dissolve
        play sound "fx/speech.mp3"
        uf4 "哇。"
        uf4 "我以前从未见过如此可怕的人"
        uf4 "现在只要看着你就让我生气！！"
        uf4 "我甚至不知道我是否还想再和你说话……"
        uf4 "如果这不是我的工作,我就不会！！"
        $achievement.grant("trashtalker")
        init:
            $achievement.register("trashtalker")
            $achievement.sync()

        $achievement.sync()
        $achievement.grant("trashtalker")
        if persistent.clubshard != True:
            play sound "fx/speech.mp3"
            uf4 "你也得到我的水晶碎片了！"
            uf4 "你这个混蛋！"
            uf2 "...."
        jump exit_clubtalk
    if persistent.clubpoints == 100:
        uf4 "... 我真的很喜欢和你说话"
        uf4 "你太完美了！"
        uf4 "就好像你从内到外都认识我一样……"
        uf4 "谢谢你和我聊天！！"
        if persistent.clubshard != True:
            play sound "fx/speech.mp3"
            uf4 "噢！我没有忘记"
            uf4 "正如承诺的那样,这就是您想要的碎片！！"
            play sound "fx/inp.mp3"
            uf2 "你得到了他们的水晶碎片"
            $ persistent.shards+= 1
            $ persistent.clubshard = True
            uf4 "我希望只是因为我给了你,你不会停止和我聊天……"
        $achievement.grant("perfect")
        init:
            $achievement.register("perfect")
            $achievement.sync()

        $achievement.sync()
        $achievement.grant("perfect")
        uf4 "有空再回来吧！！"
        uf4 "我真的很想见到更多你。。"
        jump exit_clubtalk
    if persistent.clubpoints >= 80:
        uf4 "太有趣了！！"
        uf4 "你很酷,你知道吗？"
        uf4 "总有一天会再次回心转意！"
        if persistent.clubshard != True:
            play sound "fx/speech.mp3"
            uf4 "而且...是的！"
            uf4 "正如承诺的那样,我会给你那个碎片。。"
            play sound "fx/inp.mp3"
            uf2 "你得到了他们的水晶碎片"
            $ persistent.shards+= 1
            $ persistent.clubshard = True
            uf4 "好好照顾它！！"
        uf4 "如果你有空,有时间再回来吧！我们可以再聊！"
        jump exit_clubtalk
    if persistent.clubpoints == 0:
        uf4 "...."
        uf4 "那有点...呃..."
        if persistent.clubshard != True:
            play sound "fx/speech.mp3"
            uf4 "抱歉.. 我想我不想给你我的碎片……"
        uf4 "如果你在身边,有空再过来聊聊"
        uf4 "或者不..."
        jump exit_clubtalk
    if persistent.clubpoints <= 0:
        uf4 "...."
        uf4 "你有点糟糕..."
        if persistent.clubshard != True:
            play sound "fx/speech.mp3"
            uf4 "抱歉.. 我不会把我的碎片给你这样的人……"
        uf4 "我有义务告诉你再次来拜访,"
        uf4 "但说实话我不想再和你说话了……"
        uf4 "...无论如何,如果你愿意的话我会在这里……"
        jump exit_clubtalk
    if persistent.clubpoints >= 0 and persistent.clubpoints <= 80:
        uf4 "嗯,那是...好吧！"
        uf4 "你看上去人很好"
        if persistent.clubshard != True:
            play sound "fx/speech.mp3"
            uf4 "但是！我目前还不太愿意放弃我的水晶碎片……"
            uf4 "对不起！也许我们可以再聊一会儿"
        uf4 "如果你有空,我很乐意找个时间再聊！"
        uf4 "不过,如果你还有其他地方可去,不用担心,我就在这里"
        jump exit_clubtalk
    else:
        uf4 "...."
        uf4 "没关系！我想你很酷"
        if persistent.clubshard == False:
            play sound "fx/speech.mp3"
            uf4 "但还不够酷,无法获得我的碎片……"
        uf4 "也许我们应该再聊一次！！"
        jump exit_clubtalk

